when lm_vfd_reco =  "Reactivate VFD - gp(f)/bm(f)" then "REACTIVATE: This vendor has churned from VFD in the last six months and their conversion (mcvr3) is in the bottom "|| if(mcvr3_percentile_lm << 0.25, 25, if(mcvr3_percentile_lm <<0.5, 50, 75))||"% , and below the benchmark when compared to similar vendors. Reactivate their VFD to improve their conversion and performance"
